# ai-cam-bridge — kit configuration
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and edit per-kit. `.env` is gitignored so your
# values don't leak into commits.

# BLE pairing PIN — must match the Fixed PIN you set in the Meshtastic
# Android app under Settings → Bluetooth → Fixed PIN.
# Default 123456 matches a fresh-from-factory Meshtastic node.
#
# To rotate: change this value, then run `make set-ble-pin` — the bridge
# stores the new PIN in NVS and reboots, no firmware rebuild required.
BLE_PIN=123456

# Grove Vision AI V2 (Himax WE-2) firmware version — the GitHub release tag
# from Seeed-Studio/sscma-example-we2. `20250102` is the verified baseline
# with full 10 MB model partition support (scans 0x400000..0xE00000).
# Don't downgrade — earlier images have a smaller scan window.
# `make flash-grove` downloads this version's .img to firmware/grove/.
GROVE_FIRMWARE_VERSION=20250102
